      "content": "but that's the thing, there is no \"reaching out\" when there's nobody left to reach. i look at my phone and it's just dead. i try to think about the future but it's just a void. it's like the world decided i don't belong in it anymore and i'm just... waiting for the rest of it to catch up.",
