      "content": "When everything feels permanent and hopeless, that sense of finality is incredibly heavy. It's natural to feel like you're just a leftover when the world has shifted so drastically around you. If the idea of continuing feels impossible, please consider that your current feelings are a symptom of immense pain, not a permanent truth about your worth. There are people who can help you navigate this unbearable weight right now.",
